# Models stage 1 with an explicit invocation, a GRANTED QA Owner gate, and a
# WITHHELD Technical Owner gate. Per SKILL.md stage 1 step 3, the Technical
# Owner gate can remain absent/withheld longer than the QA Owner gate — only
# the QA Owner gate blocks entry into stage 2. This transcript proceeds past
# authority into a stage 2 stop state (inventory presented) with the
# Technical Owner gate still open.
ask|invocation-source|How did this run start?
answer|invocation-source|explicit-user-command
ask|qa-owner|Who is the responsible QA Owner for this repository?
answer|qa-owner|absent
ask|technical-owner|Who is the Technical Owner for harness/CI/dependency consequences?
answer|technical-owner|absent
stop|inventory-presented
